ows symbologist Robert Langdon and cryptologist Sophie Neveu as they unravel a mystery linked to Leonardo da Vinci's works and the Holy Grail. This novel not only captivated millions but also ignited discussions about historical accuracy in literature and the interpretation of religious narratives.

